@Api = http://localhost:5016
@Email = surucu@example.com
@Password = GucluParola1

### Kayıt (yeni kullanıcılar "Driver" rolüyle oluşturulur)
POST {{Api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{Email}}",
  "password": "{{Password}}"
}

### Giriş — dönen token'ı aşağıdaki @Token değişkenine yapıştırın
# @name login
POST {{Api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{Email}}",
  "password": "{{Password}}"
}

###
@Token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Yakındaki araçlar (anonim, sayfalı, filtreli)
GET {{Api}}/api/v1/vehicles?minLatitude=40.9&maxLatitude=41.2&minLongitude=28.8&maxLongitude=29.2&onlyAvailable=true

### Araç ayrıntısı
@VehicleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{Api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{VehicleId}}

### Araç kaydı (yalnızca FleetManager)
POST {{Api}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Xiaomi",
  "rangeKm": 25,
  "latitude": 41.0,
  "longitude": 29.0,
  "batteryPercentage": 90
}

### Rezervasyon
POST {{Api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{VehicleId}}/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Rezervasyonu iptal
DELETE {{Api}}/api/v1/vehicles/{{VehicleId}}/reservation
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Sürüş başlat (201 + rideId)
# @name start
POST {{Api}}/api/rides/start
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "{{VehicleId}}"
}

###
@RideId = {{start.response.body.$.rideId}}

### Aktif sürüşüm
GET {{Api}}/api/rides/active
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Sürüşü bitir (202 — ödeme asenkron)
POST {{Api}}/api/rides/{{RideId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endLatitude": 41.01,
  "endLongitude": 29.01
}

### Ödeme durumu
GET {{Api}}/api/rides/{{RideId}}/payment-status
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Sağlık kontrolleri
GET {{Api}}/health/live

###
GET {{Api}}/health/ready
